# neck/woman/scarf: the woman's scarf in accent: wound twice about her neck below the chin, the knot on her right with its tail
# down her chest; in the side views the tail trails behind on the walk and streams back in the run (keys hang: her clips' sway
# key moves it with her stride)
# GARB-W (P2b wave 2). Fitted to one body (STYLE_P2 22). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# (FORGE-MANTLE, round 2) `when layer-scarf replace` views: the scarf over armour (STYLE_P2 28.3's over-layer SCARF): the knot on the gorget and the ends 4-5 rows down the chest facing D, streaming 4-6 px behind in the walk and the run; generated by FORGE-MANTLE gen/scarf.py.
use person woman
body woman
role neck scarf
layer neck
anchor neck
keys hang
# (FORGE-MANTLE, round 2 i3) `when layer-scarf,!beard replace`: the same scarf on layer headwear, so a camail, veil, bevor or neck guard never swallows it (a beard still lies over it: the plain `layer-scarf` views below).

